{"id":"3311342480a3371ff4e974d50a784e351c18e87c","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239988","title":"学无止境 || 给卑微的前端同学一份 Java 全栈开发和 PythonAgent 学习教程。你绝对满意！","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"wktline","excerpt":"程序员 - @wktline - 已打磨完善，大家一起学习进步！可以顺手给个 star ⭐### 特色- 从基础到快速入门 + 深入- 名词和术语解释，拒绝懵逼- Demo 和场景结合，便于理解- 覆盖常规","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-09-07 13:23:42 +08:00\">18h 34m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>大家相对比较关心学习周期和学习曲线，目前的知识内容针对稍微有后端思维的前端同学是非常友好的，可以快速入门，也可以继续深入学习，项目推荐的学习周期是完全掌握，所以如果了解到可用，大部分人 1-2 个月足够了。后续可以根据项目实战不断加深学习。</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18056866\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af0b/0ec5/668228_normal.png?m=1743223993\" alt=\"AEnjoyable\" data-uid=\"668228\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AEnjoyable\">AEnjoyable</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 11:54:02 +08:00\">20h 4m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这不是从火坑跳到另一个火坑吗前端到 Java...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18056880\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2c3175420af9d66260ee1b42d5f5f381?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kashao\" data-uid=\"338493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kashao\">kashao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 11:56:19 +08:00\">